#: ../../source/docs/bootloader.rst:5 1a3d7e95c6ec4acc8dd4343b296f73b3
msgid "Bootloader"
msgstr "引导程序"

#: ../../source/docs/bootloader.rst:7 a976e644c1614665afa11431c723e4ed
msgid ""
"The source code for the bootloaders can be found in `AP_Bootloader "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/AP_Bootloader>`__ "
"but pre-compiled binaries are available for many boards in the "
"`Tools/Bootloaders <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/Bootloaders>`__ "
"directory on our firmware server.  Please refer to the `README text "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/bootloaders/README.md>`__"
" to see if one of the existing bootloaders is compatible for the new board."
msgstr ""
"引导程序的源代码可在 `AP_Bootloader "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/AP_Bootloader>`__ "
"中找到，但许多开发板的预编译二进制文件可在固件服务器的 `Tools/Bootloaders "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/Bootloaders>`__ 目录中获取。请参阅 `README text"
" "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/bootloaders/README.md>`__"
" 以确认现有引导程序是否与新开发板兼容。"

#: ../../source/docs/bootloader.rst:13 3031c6144b1b4ffd879df897250d760e
msgid "Flash the bootloader"
msgstr "烧录引导程序"

#: ../../source/docs/bootloader.rst:15 fe11b53d1a154ebf8d6f4ac8b9e1eac6
msgid "We have currently two ways to flash the ArduPilot bootloader:"
msgstr "目前有两种方式烧录 ArduPilot 引导程序："

#: ../../source/docs/bootloader.rst:17 bc6f3033796649689518ce6abce08310
msgid ""
"flashing the one embedded into the firmware with MAVLink (recommended) via a"
" GCS"
msgstr "通过地面站使用 MAVLink（推荐）烧录固件中内嵌的引导程序"

#: ../../source/docs/bootloader.rst:18 21e0634be7c04a5c8cec16886d8b8631
msgid ""
"using DFU mode to flash. For this method, refer to :ref:`using-DFU-to-load-"
"bootloader`"
msgstr "使用 DFU 模式烧录。请参阅 :ref:`using-DFU-to-load-bootloader`"

#: ../../source/docs/bootloader.rst:21 ef7b6d7cea224143b4313425fb7e8084
msgid "With MavLink"
msgstr "通过 MAVLink"

#: ../../source/docs/bootloader.rst:23 9f32c8ce16a649b9a78129f324277be4
msgid ""
"ArduPilot firmware already include the bootloader. You can flash it using "
"the MAVLink long command : MAV_CMD_FLASH_BOOTLOADER with parameter 5 at "
"290876"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 固件中已包含引导程序。您可以使用 MAVLink 长命令：MAV_CMD_FLASH_BOOTLOADER，参数 5 设为 "
"290876 来烧录。"

#: ../../source/docs/bootloader.rst:26 45644c5bd2fd4c97b3114804d97b287c
msgid "Mavproxy"
msgstr "MAVProxy"

#: ../../source/docs/bootloader.rst:28 23059def2b504a91a5e028f797a036b8
msgid "In Mavproxy terminal, type : flashbootloader"
msgstr "在 MAVProxy 终端中输入：flashbootloader"

#: ../../source/docs/bootloader.rst:31 80203de84b6240f3a971a881af71554e
msgid "Mission Planner"
msgstr "Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/bootloader.rst:33 d23e03670ca64493898e3e0bd0ba5b69
msgid "Use the SETUP->Install Firmware page's \"Bootloader Update\" button"
msgstr "使用 SETUP->Install Firmware 页面中的「Bootloader Update」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/bootloader.rst:36 f2bc4059a34941e8889a75fd74c33abe
msgid "Flash Firmware via UART (Telem Port)"
msgstr "通过 UART（数传端口）烧录固件"

#: ../../source/docs/bootloader.rst:38 13dd6b8a6d67489c92f62234f2329aa1
msgid ""
"Certain boards are capable of updating the firmware through a serial/UART "
"connection in addition to the USB port on the autopilot. The boards capable "
"of this will reference a UART in their respective "
"``ardupilot/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/*your autopilot*/hwdef-bl.dat`` "
"file. After verifying the board you want to flash is capable of this, "
"navigate to the ``ardupilot/Tools/scripts`` directory."
msgstr ""
"某些开发板除 USB 端口外还可通过串口/UART 连接更新固件。具备此功能的开发板会在其对应的 "
"``ardupilot/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/*your autopilot*/hwdef-bl.dat`` "
"文件中引用 UART。确认目标开发板支持此功能后，进入 ``ardupilot/Tools/scripts`` 目录。"

#: ../../source/docs/bootloader.rst:40 a71337f764c54e20b9afc1830a39ee71
msgid ""
"Within this directory is a script called ``uploader.py`` which you will use "
"to flash the firmware. Typing ``./uploader.py --help`` will display the "
"different arguments available to you. These will be modified depending on "
"your specific hardware and baudrate configuration in your setup and "
"autopilot. In this example a CubeBlack via a USB-TTL cable is used, with the"
" baudrate set to 921600 on the Telem1 port."
msgstr ""
"该目录中有一个名为 ``uploader.py`` 的脚本，用于烧录固件。输入 ``./uploader.py --help`` "
"可查看可用参数。这些参数需根据您的具体硬件和配置中的波特率进行调整。本例使用通过 USB-TTL 线连接的 CubeBlack，Telem1 "
"端口波特率设为 921600。"

#: ../../source/docs/bootloader.rst:42 8bd9741b9aed4bb2b69fe9050fc12598
msgid ""
"Verify your device with a simple ``dmesg``. The output should look something"
" like this:"
msgstr "使用简单的 ``dmesg`` 命令确认您的设备。输出应类似如下："

#: ../../source/docs/bootloader.rst:50 924468ea1fa249e7987f14621c6a12a3
msgid ""
"Now that we know which device to utilize for flashing, execute the script "
"with the appropriate flags. The ``--baud-bootloader-flash \"921600\"`` is "
"important to speed up the upload process. If left at the default "
"``\"57600\"`` you could be waiting some time for the firmware to upload. The"
" ``--buad-flightstack \"921600\"`` needs to match your ``SERIALX_BAUDRATE`` "
"in order to send the mavlink commands for the update. Successful execution "
"should output to the terminal like this:"
msgstr ""
"确认要使用的设备后，使用适当的标志执行脚本。``--baud-bootloader-flash \"921600\"`` "
"对于加快上传速度非常重要。若保持默认 ``\"57600\"``，固件上传将耗时较长。``--buad-flightstack \"921600\"``"
" 需要与 ``SERIALX_BAUDRATE`` 匹配，以便发送 MAVLink 更新命令。成功执行后终端输出应如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/bootloader.rst:86 a466f3ec37d44023a61ef0e6d34ee6db
msgid ""
"Verify the firmware update by executing ``mavproxy.py --master "
"/dev/ttyUSB0,921600``."
msgstr "通过执行 ``mavproxy.py --master /dev/ttyUSB0,921600`` 验证固件更新。"
